    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "order": 92,
    "anchor": "8-deploy-armies-2",
    "summary": "Starting with the Defender, teams take turns setting up units:\n\n- 1 unit per turn, wholly within the team's deployment zone, leaving out units in **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**\n- after setting up a **TITANIC** unit, the team skips its next set-up turn\n- once one team has set up all its units, the other sets up the rest of its own",
